OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers build 'leaky dams' to
OL,4,Afight flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers in an Oxfordshire village
OL,7,Fare building natural timber barriers in
OL,8,Fa bid to protect their community from
OL,9,Ffuture flooding.
OL,11,FAt least 62 properties in Bloxham were
OL,12,Fdamaged during Storm Bert in November
OL,13,F2024, according to the parish council.
OL,15,FJudith Macfarlane, 53, a Bloxham
OL,16,Fresident whose home was flooded during
OL,17,Fthe storm, said it had been "pretty
OL,18,Fdevastating".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
