OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers build 'leaky dams' to
OL,4,Afight flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe is one of around a dozen volunteers
OL,7,Fhelping to construct the "leaky woody
OL,8,Fdams" in The Slade, a nature reserve on
OL,9,Fthe edge of the village.
